        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"WarrenAC\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/d2c977/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> WarrenAC:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’m mostly watching in hopes of seeing something positive…so far I’ve only heard about when we won’t get things, which isn’t the most reassuring.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Why’s it not reassuring? What do you expect to be said?<br>\nIt will be coming, but not before the physical release, you just need to be patient.</p>",
        "post_number": 9,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:44:53.083Z",
