      {
        "id": 213826,
        "name": "WarrenAC",
        "username": "WarrenAC",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/d2c977/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-29T03:40:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I expect they will give us a release date once they are sure they can keep it, because they have been very solid about their release dates once they announce them.&nbsp; What I have noticed is that there is no release date on any of the upcoming things,&nbsp; so right now the Oblivaeon ship date doesn't actually mean anything positive for the digital side. I do think there are probably going to be a lot of people sorely disappointed if a ton of content doesn't drop then,&nbsp; because I think their current strategy of saying \"we can't deliver any content till Oblivaeon ships\" is being generally misread as \"we will deliver XYZ when Oblivaeon ships\". I'm currently forcing myself to take them literally which is ...&nbsp;</p><p><span>From this thread, maybe the release date for the release dates is soon-ish...but correct me if I'm wrong I think even that is currently wishful thinking and not even stream hints so far?</span></p>",
        "post_number": 10,
        "post_type": 1,
