        "raw": "<p>I expect they will give us a release date once they are sure they can keep it, because they have been very solid about their release dates once they announce them.&nbsp; What I have noticed is that there is no release date on any of the upcoming things,&nbsp; so right now the Oblivaeon ship date doesn&#39;t actually mean anything positive for the digital side. I do think there are probably going to be a lot of people sorely disappointed if a ton of content doesn&#39;t drop then,&nbsp; because I think their current strategy of saying &quot;we can&#39;t deliver any content till Oblivaeon ships&quot; is being generally misread as &quot;we will deliver XYZ when Oblivaeon ships&quot;. I&#39;m currently forcing myself to take them literally which is ...&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">From this thread, maybe the release date for the release dates is soon-ish...but correct me if I&#39;m wrong I think even that is currently wishful thinking and not even stream hints so far?</span></p>",
