        "created_at": "2018-01-29T11:42:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We never give release dates out well in advance. When there is a date to announce, it will be announced.</p><p>Mini-Pack 4, Mini-Pack 5, and OblivAeon will not be released on digital before the physical version is shipped. We have not said anything else about when they will be released on digital. Do not read anything more into it than what it says.</p>",
